++2. **H3's 24-hour total fuzz campaign** across broader targets remains on the
++   H3 plan; the recorded W1 campaigns are bounded observations only.
++3. **Mainnet** curve/path/coin-type allocation and migration policy remain
++   separate future decisions; this format is testnet-only.
++
++Review any format change as a versioned compatibility decision (new numbered
++document, reviewed differences, recorded migration impact); do not silently
++rewrite historical receipts or this text.
